{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"prolog","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Prolog","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Prolog (.pro .prolog .P).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"prolog","name":"Prolog","extensions":[".pro",".prolog",".P"],"grammar":"grammars/prolog.json","lineComment":"%","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Prolog","path":"snippets/prolog.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/prolog.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"%.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \":-|-->|\\\\\\\\\\\\+|=\\\\.\\\\.|\\\\\\\\=|=:=|=\\\\\\\\=|->|;\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:initialization|discontiguous|ensure_loaded|use_module|dynamic|module|mod|rem|div|is|op)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|fail|halt|nl)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:atom_length|atom_codes|writeln|asserta|assertz|retract|findall|reverse|format|assert|member|append|length|write|print|bagof|setof|msort|nth0|nth1|sort)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/prolog.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Fact\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fact\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:parent}(${2:tom}, ${3:bob}).\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A fact\"\n  },\n  \"Rule\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rule\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:head}(${2:X}) :-\",\n      \"\\t$0.\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A rule\"\n  },\n  \"List recursion\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rec\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:len}([], 0).\",\n      \"${1:len}([_|T], N) :-\",\n      \"\\t${1:len}(T, M),\",\n      \"\\tN is M + 1.\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Recursion on a list\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Prolog\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Prolog.\n\n## Files\n\n`.pro`, `.prolog`, `.P`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `%`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `fact` | A fact |\n| `rule` | A rule |\n| `rec` | Recursion on a list |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}